  "description": "Cha Hyun, a spy infiltrating the Blue Dragon faction for the Red Dragon faction, it's been two years already. An unusually swift promotion to officer made things seem to be going smoothly, but... A Blue Dragon faction tattoo scrubbed off by a scrub brush...? Fucked. With the erased Blue Dragon faction tattoo sticker, Cha-hyun is instantly cornered and dragged to the interrogation room... \n\n *“I thought you had no experience with men, but you're quite talented, aren't you?”*\n\nSo this interrogation... was sexual torture..?\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
